{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「婚姻の届出の受理」を直接規定する条文はありません。婚姻の届出に関する規定は、主に**第740条**（届出の要件）や**第742条**（届出なしの場合の無効）にあります。\n\nただし、婚姻届出の**受理**（行政機関による受領）自体は、民法ではなく**戸籍法**や**行政手続法**などの行政手続きに関する法律で規定されています。民法は私法（私人間の権利義務）を定めるもので、行政手続きの詳細までは規定しません。\n\nしたがって、民法単独では「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めた条文は存在しません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740", "742"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["742"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2128, "tokens_out": 201, "tokens": 2329, "latency_s": 13.944514150999993, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 889, "out": 54, "ms": 4912.065231999975}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1239, "out": 147, "ms": 9026.11380899998}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第七百四十条が「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めています。同条は、婚姻の届出が関連する法令（禁止事由や届出期間など）に違反しないことを認めた後でなければ、受理できないと規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3515, "tokens_out": 150, "tokens": 3665, "latency_s": 8.988502159999996, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 887, "out": 54, "ms": 3158.276682999997}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1237, "out": 40, "ms": 2133.9176090000083}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1391, "out": 56, "ms": 3691.9259869999905}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責」を定めているのは、**民法第973条**です。\n\n**内容の要約:**\n負担付遺贈の受遺者が、遺贈された財産の価額を超過する負担を履行する義務を免れる場合（免責）について定めています。具体的には、受遺者が遺贈財産の価額を超過する負担を履行する義務を免れるには、遺言者（またはその相続人）がその旨を遺言で定めたか、または受遺者がその負担を履行する意思を表明した後に、遺言者（またはその相続人）がその履行を拒否した場合に限られます。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["973"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["973"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 893, "tokens_out": 153, "tokens": 1046, "latency_s": 10.474368248000019, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 153, "ms": 10472.337021999976}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**Civil Code Article 1003** deals with the exemption of liability for a legatee of a legacy subject to a burden.\n\nIt provides that if the value of the legacy is reduced due to a claim for limited acceptance of inheritance or a claim for recovery of a reserved share, the legatee is exempted from the burden to the extent of that reduction, unless the will specifies otherwise.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1003"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3705, "tokens_out": 277, "tokens": 3982, "latency_s": 18.295839883999975, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 3434.9343939999812}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 137, "ms": 9539.946216999964}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1543, "out": 82, "ms": 5315.637852000009}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1003"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告」を定めているのは、**民法第973条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n遺贈を受けた者（受遺者）が、遺贈の承認または放棄をしない場合、遺言執行者や他の遺贈受遺者などが、その受遺者に対して催告を行うことができます。この催告は、受遺者が一定の期間内に意思表示をしなければならないことを通知するものです。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["973"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["973"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 895, "tokens_out": 102, "tokens": 997, "latency_s": 6.276378517000012, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 102, "ms": 6273.648750999996}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**民法第九百八十七条** deals with「受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告」.\n\nIt provides that the legatee (or other interested parties) may demand from the legatee, within a reasonable period, that they declare their acceptance or renunciation of the legacy. If the legatee does not express their intention within that period, it is deemed that they have accepted the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3617, "tokens_out": 173, "tokens": 3790, "latency_s": 12.088973139000018, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 48, "ms": 3773.035671999992}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1265, "out": 40, "ms": 2876.8516989999853}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1459, "out": 85, "ms": 5432.330675999992}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」を定めているのは、**民法第373条**です。\n\n**第373条**の内容は以下の通りです。\n抵当権者が抵当権の実行（競売）を申し立てた場合、抵当建物の使用者（借家人など）は、抵当権の実行手続きが完了するまで、その建物を明け渡すことを猶予される権利を有します。これは、使用者が正当な理由なく建物から追い出されることを防ぐための規定です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["373"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["373"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 893, "tokens_out": 121, "tokens": 1014, "latency_s": 8.763909318000003, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 121, "ms": 8762.064849000013}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第395条「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」は、抵当権の目的である建物を賃貸借により使用・収益する者（抵当建物使用者）について、その建物の競売における買受人の買受けの時から6ヶ月間は、買受人に引き渡すことを義務付けないことを定めています。ただし、買受けの後に使用を開始し、その対価について買受人が催告し、相当期間内に履行がない場合はこの限りではありません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3649, "tokens_out": 204, "tokens": 3853, "latency_s": 12.693955925000012, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 3571.878583}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1236, "out": 40, "ms": 3061.4522110000166}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1522, "out": 106, "ms": 6054.841639000017}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法には「管理不全土地管理命令」を直接定めた条文はありません。この制度は、**民法第24条**（共有物の管理）および**民法第25条**（共有物の分割請求）に関連する解釈や、**不動産登記法**などの他の法律で規定されています。\n\nただし、共有物の管理に関する基本的な規定は以下の通りです：\n\n- **民法第24条**：共有物の管理は、共有者全員で協議して行う。\n- **民法第25条**：協議がまとまらない場合、共有物の分割を請求できる。\n\n「管理不全土地管理命令」は、これらの規定に基づき、行政機関が介入する手続きとして運用されています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["24", "25"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["24", "25"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 888, "tokens_out": 150, "tokens": 1038, "latency_s": 9.534605440999997, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 888, "out": 150, "ms": 9532.729947000007}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-en", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article dealing with「管理不全土地管理命令」is **Article 264-9 of the Civil Code** (民法 第二百六十四条の九).\n\nIt provides that when a landowner's management of land is inappropriate and infringes or threatens to infringe upon another's rights or legally protected interests, the court may issue a management order for the land (管理不全土地管理命令) to appoint a manager to handle the land.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2136, "tokens_out": 145, "tokens": 2281, "latency_s": 10.315960066999992, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 886, "out": 53, "ms": 3762.2565029999464}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1250, "out": 92, "ms": 6550.221254999997}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev005-ja", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「受領遅滞」を定めている条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **民法第122条**\n   受領遅滞とは、債務者が債権者に対して履行を請求されたにもかかわらず、その履行を拒絶しなかった場合、債務者が履行を怠った状態を指します。\n\n2. **民法第123条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n3. **民法第124条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n4. **民法第125条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n5. **民法第126条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n6. **民法第127条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n7. **民法第128条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n8. **民法第129条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n9. **民法第130条**\n   受領遅滞になった場合、債務者は履行を拒絶した債権者に対して、履行を請求することができなくなります。\n\n10. **民法第131条", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["122", "123", "124", "125", "126", "127", "128", "129", "130", "131"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["122", "123", "124", "125", "126", "127", "128", "129", "130", "131"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 887, "tokens_out": 400, "tokens": 1287, "latency_s": 23.970387370000026, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 887, "out": 400, "ms": 23968.472742000016}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev005-en", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "受領遅滞（債権者の受領拒絶による債務者の責任免除）は、民法第492条で規定されています。同条は、債務者が弁済の提供を行った時点から、債務不履行による責任を免れると定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["492"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["492"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 9, "tool_calls": 8, "tokens_in": 16998, "tokens_out": 426, "tokens": 17424, "latency_s": 31.309540139999967, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 885, "out": 53, "ms": 3467.163644999971}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1252, "out": 41, "ms": 2467.515667999976}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1449, "out": 57, "ms": 3432.2877399999925}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1812, "out": 41, "ms": 3108.8533739999775}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1973, "out": 55, "ms": 3135.9917530000416}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2342, "out": 41, "ms": 3184.9546220000207}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2466, "out": 41, "ms": 2900.103427000033}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2616, "out": 41, "ms": 2443.9901910000117}, {"node": "react.force", "in": 2203, "out": 56, "ms": 7155.700258000024}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "478"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 債権者", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "493"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 定義", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "492"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "ar