{"id": "dev006-ja", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "健康保険法で「子ども・子育て支援金率」を定めているのは第百六十条の二です。その直後の条文は**第百六十条の三**です。\n\n**第百六十条の三（準備金）**：保険者は、健康保険事業の費用支出に備えるため、毎事業年度末に準備金を積み立てなければならない。また、収支の見通しから事業運営に支障が生じる恐れがある場合は、厚生労働大臣に報告し、必要な措置を講じる必要がある。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5455, "tokens_out": 255, "tokens": 5710, "latency_s": 18.32375069599999, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 3013.4330529999716}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1293, "out": 44, "ms": 3676.3145279999776}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1515, "out": 44, "ms": 3066.991518000009}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1750, "out": 111, "ms": 8560.314688999995}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-en", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "The article immediately after 第百六十条の二 (Article 160-2) on 「子ども・子育て支援金率」is **第百六十条の三 (Article 160-3)**.\n\nIt provides that insurers must establish a **reserve fund** at the end of each fiscal year to prepare for expenses related to health insurance operations, as prescribed by government ordinance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5435, "tokens_out": 226, "tokens": 5661, "latency_s": 17.140145261999976, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 892, "out": 56, "ms": 3950.37056700005}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1288, "out": 44, "ms": 3333.010609999974}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1510, "out": 44, "ms": 3199.5626719999564}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1745, "out": 82, "ms": 6651.517363000039}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-ja", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "「法律上の減軽と刑の選択」を定めているのは刑法第69条です。この条文の直後の条文は**刑法第70条**です。\n\n**刑法第70条**の内容を要約すると、「法律上の減軽事由がある場合、その事由を考慮して刑を減軽した後、それでもなお重い刑が必要と認められるときは、その刑を酌量減軽することができる」としています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2115, "tokens_out": 148, "tokens": 2263, "latency_s": 9.950834111999939, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 4327.398982999966}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1218, "out": 92, "ms": 5619.462793000025}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-en", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 69 is **Article 70** of the Penal Code. It provides that when reducing a term of imprisonment or detention results in a fraction of less than one day, that fraction shall be discarded.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3476, "tokens_out": 179, "tokens": 3655, "latency_s": 13.689065924000033, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 56, "ms": 4394.814895999957}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1214, "out": 75, "ms": 5721.208081999976}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1369, "out": 48, "ms": 3567.6548389999425}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "70"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-ja", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "健康保険法で「資格の得喪の確認」を定めているのは第39条です。その直後の条文は**第40条**です。\n\n**第40条の内容要約**: 被保険者の標準報酬月額を、その報酬月額に基づき等級区分によって定めることを規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6474, "tokens_out": 205, "tokens": 6679, "latency_s": 15.016343585999948, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 896, "out": 56, "ms": 4274.190032999968}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1269, "out": 41, "ms": 2582.1040129999346}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1581, "out": 41, "ms": 3301.7007329999615}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2728, "out": 67, "ms": 4852.242617000002}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-en", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 39 (資格の得喪の確認) in the Health Insurance Act is **Article 40 (標準報酬月額)**.\n\nArticle 40 establishes the standard remuneration monthly amount (標準報酬月額) based on the insured person's remuneration monthly amount, defining the grade classification and corresponding amounts.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6454, "tokens_out": 205, "tokens": 6659, "latency_s": 18.68862399300008, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 55, "ms": 6219.326894000005}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1264, "out": 41, "ms": 3209.865720000039}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1576, "out": 41, "ms": 3406.404633999955}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2723, "out": 68, "ms": 5846.099577000018}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-ja", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "「譲受会社による債務の引受け」を定めているのは会社法第23条です。その直後の条文は第23条の2（id 23-2）です。\n\n**第23条の2の内容要約**：\n事業譲渡において、譲渡会社が債権者を害することを知らずに債務を承継しない場合、残存債権者は譲受会社に対して承継した財産の価額を限度として債務履行を請求できる。ただし、譲受会社が債権者を害することを知らなかった場合は請求できない。また、この請求権は譲渡会社の破産・再生・更生手続開始後は行使できない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23", "23-2"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 3875, "tokens_out": 284, "tokens": 4159, "latency_s": 24.106392355000025, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 1}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 898, "out": 57, "ms": 6502.914137999937}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1276, "out": 84, "ms": 5745.317574000069}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1701, "out": 143, "ms": 11850.209777000033}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-3"}, "ok": false}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-en", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "The article immediately after 第二十三条の二 (Article 23-2) on 「譲受会社による債務の引受け」 is **第二十三条の三 (Article 23-3)**.\n\nIt provides that when a transferor company has transferred its business to a transferee company and the transferee company has assumed the debts of the transferor company, the transferee company may request the transferor company to perform the debts assumed by the transferee company.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23-2", "23-3"], "invalid": ["23-3"], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3797, "tokens_out": 196, "tokens": 3993, "latency_s": 15.570868798000106, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 57, "ms": 3878.299900000002}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 42, "ms": 4765.926725999975}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1633, "out": 97, "ms": 6918.098973000042}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-ja", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "「弁済の場所及び時間」を定めているのは民法第484条です。この条文の直後にあるのは第485条です。\n\n**第485条の内容要約**: 弁済の費用の負担について、別段の意思表示がない場合は債務者の負担とするが、債権者が住所移転などで費用を増加させた場合は例外とする。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2146, "tokens_out": 136, "tokens": 2282, "latency_s": 11.060565337000071, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 54, "ms": 3928.664857000058}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1251, "out": 82, "ms": 7127.137931999982}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-en", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 484 (弁済の場所及び時間) is **Article 485 of the Civil Code (弁済の費用)**.\n\nIt provides that unless otherwise agreed, the costs of performance are borne by the debtor, except for any increase in costs caused by the creditor's actions, such as moving residence.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5135, "tokens_out": 205, "tokens": 5340, "latency_s": 13.644495226999993, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 54, "ms": 3253.4239839999373}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1247, "out": 40, "ms": 3023.962838999978}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1423, "out": 40, "ms": 2916.73106799999}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1574, "out": 71, "ms": 4441.768194000019}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "484"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "485"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev011-ja", "item_id": "dev011", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["97"], "anchor": ["96"], "answer": "民法で「詐欺又は強迫」を規定する条文は主に第96条（意思表示の取消し）と第747条（婚姻の取消し）です。\n\n質問の「直後に置かれている条文」は、条文の順序（条文番号の大小）で判断します。\n\n1.  **第96条**の直後（次条）は**第97条**です。\n    *   **第97条の内容**: 詐欺又は強迫による取消権の行使期限（1年）と、第三者が詐欺を行った場合の相手方の過失による取消権の制限を定めています。\n\n2.  **第747条**の直後（次条）は**第748条**です。\n    *   **第748条の内容**: 詐欺又は強迫による婚姻の取消権の行使期限（1年）を定めています。\n\nしたがって、条文番号は**第97条**（または第748条）であり、内容は**詐欺又は強迫による取消権の行使期限**を定めた条文です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["96", "747", "97", "748"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["747", "748"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2136, "tokens_out": 292, "tokens": 2428, "latency_s": 20.95365197600006, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 52, "ms": 4203.9611950000335}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1243, "out": 240, "ms": 16745.678739000028}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "詐欺又は強迫", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev011-en", "item_id": "dev011", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["97"], "anchor": ["96"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 747 is **Article 748** (婚姻の取消しの効力). It provides that the effect of annulling a marriage is retroactive only for the future, and specifies the obligation to return property acquired during the marriage, with stricter return requirements for parties who knew of the grounds for annulment at the time of marriage.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["747", "748"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["747", "748"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3594, "tokens_out": 193, "tokens": 3787, "latency_s": 13.843852741999967, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 889, "out": 52, "ms": 3513.778787999968}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1239, "out": 64, "ms": 4548.8747719999765}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1466, "out": 77, "ms": 5775.797474000001}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "詐欺又は強迫", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "748"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev012-ja", "item_id": "dev012", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["870", "1015"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「後見の計算」と「遺言執行者の行為の効果」を定める条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **後見の計算**\n   - **民法 872条**：後見人が管理する財産の計算方法（貸借の清算）を定めています。\n\n2. **遺言執行者の行為の効果**\n   - **民法 1000条**：遺言執行者が行った行為について、その効果について定めています（遺言者の意思に従った行為は有効とみなされるなど）。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["872", "1000"], "invalid": ["1000"], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["872"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 895, "tokens_out": 117, "tokens": 1012, "latency_s": 6.715250520999916, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 117, "ms": 6713.22636900004}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev012-en", "item_id": "dev012", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["870", "1015"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**「後見の計算」に関する条文:**\n*   **民法第870条**: 後見人の任務終了後、後見人等は2ヶ月以内に後見の計算をしなければならない。\n*   **民法第871条**: 後見の計算は、後見監督人がいる場合はその立会いのもとに行わなければならない。\n*   **民法第872条**: 未成年被後見人が成年に達した後、後見の計算終了前にされた契約は、その者が取り消せる。\n*   **民法第873条**: 後見の計算終了時から利息を付さなければならない。\n*   **民法第966条**: 後見の計算終了前に、後見人等の利益となる遺言は無効とする。\n\n**「遺言執行者の行為の効果」に関する条文:**\n*   **民法第1012条**: 遺言執行者は、遺言実現のため必要な一切の行為をする権利義務を有する。\n*   **民法第1015条**: 遺言執行者が権限内で行った行為は、相続人に対して直接効力を生ずる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["870", "871", "872", "873", "966", "1012", "1015"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["871", "872", "873", "966", "1012"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2498, "tokens_out": 359, "tokens": 2857, "latency_s": 22.435903029000087, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 894, "out": 108, "ms": 7593.3813550000195}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1604, "out": 251, "ms": 14837.727975000007}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "後見の計算", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言執行者の行為の効果", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev013-ja", "item_id": "dev013", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["189", "167"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「審査請求及び再審査請求」は**第189条**（被保険者等に対する処分不服時の審査請求）、**第190条**（保険料賦課等処分不服時の審査請求）、**第191条**（行政不服審査法への準用）に定められています。\n\n「保険料の源泉控除」は**第167条**（事業主による報酬支払時の保険料控除）に定められています。\n\n要約：\n- **第189条**: 被保険者等に対する処分（資格、標準報酬、保険給付）に不服がある場合の審査請求手続き。\n- **第190条**: 保険料賦課・徴収処分等に不服がある場合の審査請求手続き。\n- **第191条**: 審査請求・再審査請求については行政不服審査法が準用される。\n- **第167条**: 事業主が被保険者に報酬を支払う際、その額から前月の標準報酬月額に係る保険料を控除して支払うことができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["189", "190", "191", "167"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["190", "191"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2539, "tokens_out": 347, "tokens": 2886, "latency_s": 21.954663857000014, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 899, "out": 112, "ms": 7834.536304999915}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1640, "out": 235, "ms": 14115.32127299995}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "審査請求及び再審査請求", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "保険料の源泉控除", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev013-en", "item_id": "dev013", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["189", "167"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**健康保険法 第百八十九条**：被保険者の資格、標準報酬又は保険給付に関する処分に不服がある者は、社会保険審査官に対して審査請求をし、その決定に不服がある者は、社会保険審査会に対して再審査請求をすることができる。\n\n**健康保険法 第百九十条**：保険料等の賦課若しくは徴収の処分又は第百八十条の規定による処分に不服がある者は、社会保険審査会に対して審査請求をすることができる。\n\n**健康保険法 第百六十七条**：事業主は、被保険者に対して通貨をもって報酬を支払う場合においては、被保険者の負担すべき保険料を報酬から控除することができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["189", "190", "180", "167"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["190", "180"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 6, "tokens_in": 4932, "tokens_out": 426, "tokens": 5358, "latency_s": 29.52373749100002, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 112, "ms": 8386.671944}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1638, "out": 168, "ms": 11306.056005000073}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2397, "out": 146, "ms": 9823.210139000024}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "審査請求及び再審査請求", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "保険料の源泉控除", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "189"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "190"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "191"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "167"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev014-ja", "item_id": "dev014", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["263", "20"], "anchor": [], "answer": "刑法における「信書隠匿」は**第二百六十三条**、「没収の制限」は**第四十九条**です。\n\n*   **第二百六十三条（信書隠匿罪）**：他人の信書を隠匿した者は、六月以下の拘禁刑又は十万円以下の罰金若しくは科料に処する。\n*   **第四十九条（没収の制限）**：併合罪のうちの重い罪について没収を科さない場合であっても、他の罪について没収の事由があるときは、これを付加することができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["263", "49"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["49"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2237, "tokens_out": 219, "tokens": 2456, "latency_s": 14.624311788, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 104, "ms": 6277.942694000103}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1344, "out": 115, "ms": 8342.543462999969}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "信書隠匿", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 3}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "没収の制限", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 3}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev014-en", "item_id": "dev014", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["263", "20"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**刑法 第二百六十三条（信書隠匿）**：他人の信書を隠匿した者は、六月以下の拘禁刑又は十万円以下の罰金若しくは科料に処する。\n\n**刑法 第四十九条（没収の付加）**：併合罪のうち重い罪で没収を科さない場合でも、他の罪で没収の事由があるときは、これを付加することができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["263", "49"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["49"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 4304, "tokens_out": 269, "tokens": 4573, "latency_s": 18.91978286099993, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 892, "out": 104, "ms": 6154.32900199994}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1578, "out": 79, "ms": 6628.9011770001025}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1834, "out": 86, "ms": 6131.0457080001015}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "信書隠匿", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "没収の制限", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "263"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "49"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev015-ja", "item_id": "dev015", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["950", "774-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「業務の休廃止」は、**会社法第950条**（調査機関の業務休止・廃止）に定められています。\n「株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用」は、**会社法第774条の6**（株式交付子会社の株式譲渡に関する規定の準用）に定められています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["950", "774-6"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["774-6"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2557, "tokens_out": 196, "tokens": 2753, "latency_s": 14.264930787999901, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 904, "out": 116, "ms": 8673.101203999977}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1653, "out": 80, "ms": 5583.47348999996}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "業務の休廃止", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev015-en", "item_id": "dev015", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["950", "774-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「業務の休廃止」は、会社法第九百五十七条（電子公告調査の業務の実施）で、法務大臣が業務を休止・廃止した場合の手続きを定めています。「株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用」は、会社法第七百七十四条の六で、株式交付子会社の株式を譲渡しようとする者が株式交付親会社が譲り受ける株式の総数の譲渡しを行う契約を締結する場合は、前二条（第七百七十四条の四・五）の規定を適用しないことを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["957", "774-6", "774-4"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["957", "774-6", "774-4"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 4685, "tokens_out": 324, "tokens": 5009, "latency_s": 21.730841744999907, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 902, "out": 116, "ms": 7121.200735000002}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1651, "out": 84, "ms": 6831.369502000143}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2132, "out": 124, "ms": 7767.757442000175}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "業務の休廃止", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "957"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "774-6"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev016-ja", "item_id": "dev016", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["914", "468"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「遺言による担保責任の定め」という表現は、民法の条文では直接的に見当たりません。おそらく、**「遺言による負担（負担付遺贈）」**に関する**第1002条**（負担付遺贈）が、遺言で定められた義務（負担）の履行責任に関する規定として該当すると考えられます。\n\n一方、「債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁」は、**第467条**（債権の譲渡の対抗要件）に明記されています。\n\nしたがって、回答は以下の通りです。\n\n*   **遺言による担保責任の定め**: **民法第1002条**（負担付遺贈）。負担付遺贈を受けた者は、遺贈の目的の価額を超えない限度においてのみ、負担した義務を履行する責任を負う。\n*   **債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁**: **民法第467条**（債権の譲渡の対抗要件）。債権の譲渡は、譲渡人が債務者に通知し、又は債務者が承諾しなければ、債務者その他の第三者に対抗することができない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002", "467"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002", "467"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 3, "quotes_unsupported": 3}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 5, "tokens_in": 6530, "tokens_out": 748, "tokens": 7278, "latency_s": 45.79259632200001, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 902, "out": 142, "ms": 8032.099875000085}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1438, "out": 121, "ms": 8392.392014999814}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1842, "out": 240, "ms": 13084.861667000041}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2348, "out": 245, "ms": 16273.908523999808}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言による担保責任", "law": "民法", "top_k": 3}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "債権の譲渡 債務者の抗弁", "law": "民法", "top_k": 3}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言 担保責任", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "467"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1002"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev016-en", "item_id": "dev016", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["914", "468"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「遺言による担保責任の定め」は民法に直接規定されていません。遺言執行者の責任は第1016条（復任権）で規定されています。\n\n「債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁」は以下の条文で規定されています：\n- **民法第467条**：債権譲渡は債務者に通知または承諾がない限り、債務者や第三者に対抗できない（対抗要件）。\n- **民法第469条**：債務者は、対抗要件具備前に取得した譲渡人に対する債権で相殺できる（抗弁権）。\n\nこれらが該当する規定です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1016", "467", "469"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1016", "467", "469"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 5, "tokens_in": 4831, "tokens_out": 378, "tokens": 5209, "latency_s": 25.827217722999876, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 901, "out": 115, "ms": 8046.8974909999815}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1630, "out": 124, "ms": 7644.392308000079}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2300, "out": 139, "ms": 10126.179818000082}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言による担保責任の定め", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "1016"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "467"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "469"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev017-ja", "item_id": "dev017", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["805", "400"], "anchor": [], "answer": "会社法における「新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合」と「委員の選定等」を定めた条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合**\n   **会社法第463条**\n   新設分割計画が、分割する会社の株主総会に提出されることなく、分割する会社の取締役会によって承認された場合、または分割する会社の株主総会において承認された場合など、特定の条件を満たすときは、その計画の承認を要しない旨を定めています。\n\n2. **委員の選定等**\n   **会社法第464条**\n   新設分割を行う場合、分割する会社の株主総会において、分割計画の執行に関し必要な事項を調査するため、委員を選任する旨を定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["463", "464"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["463", "464"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 901, "tokens_out": 181, "tokens": 1082, "latency_s": 11.763176985999962, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 901, "out": 181, "ms": 11757.649999000023}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev017-en", "item_id": "dev017", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["805", "400"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合」は、会社法第764条（株式会社）、第766条（持分会社）で規定されています。これらは新設分割設立会社の権利義務承継の効力を定めており、承認不要の具体的な条件を直接示す条文ではありません。\n\n「委員の選定等」は、会社法第400条（各委員会の委員の選定）、第401条（委員の解職等）、第342条の2（監査等委員の選任等）、第47条（設立時代表取締役の選定）などで規定されています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["764", "766", "400", "401", "342-2", "47"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["764", "766", "401", "342-2", "47"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 11, "tokens_in": 7446, "tokens_out": 624, "tokens": 8070, "latency_s": 49.35264561399981, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 899, "out": 113, "ms": 13907.34666000003}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1617, "out": 370, "ms": 23341.421918999913}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 4930, "out": 141, "ms": 12089.717697999959}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "委員の選定等", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "764"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "762"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "763"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "766"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "342-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "400"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "401"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"l